   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender equality and women`s empowerment in agriculture, food security and nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: contribute to closing the gender gap in agriculture by enhancing rural women?s economic empowerment and strengthening their voice and role as agents of change in rural development, decision-making and resilience building.

1.       Enhance capacities of member states to design and implement gender-sensitive agricultural, food security, nutrition policies and programmes.
2.       Enhance rural women?s agency, participation and voice in community and producer?s organizations.
3.       Increase rural women?s access to and control over productive resources, knowledge, services, market opportunities and lucrative value chains.
4.       Increase the use of the Dimitra Clubs? model in rural development initiatives and strategies for promoting gender equality and rural women?s leadership and increasing impact of development initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
